{"title":"적당한 온도","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=s0lSb/hzXalyu2AT/fzz26Xyy8rThvkEczCTcQ1&filename=th3","synopsis":"김민지, 23세. 아주 흔한 이름과 흔한 얼굴을 가진 일명 '흔녀'. 나는 온도를 자유자재로 다룰 수 있다.\n 일종의 초능력인 것 같지만 무언가 특별한 일이 일어나진 않는다. 보통 사람들과 똑같은 일상, 똑같은 생각, 똑같은 인생…. 그런데 꼭 내 인생에 특별한 일이 일어나야 하는 걸까? 고작 온도를 조절할 수 있는 능력을 갖추게 됐다고 슈퍼 히어로라도 돼야 하는 걸까?\n 나는 나대로 좋고, 내 모습 그대로가 좋다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":275,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":275,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":257,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":287,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":184,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":208,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":189,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":261,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":248,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":203,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":274,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":253,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-